WEBVTT

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.380
Sonshin...

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.980
<b>Arrows rain down
from heaven.</b>

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:12.490
<b>Water flies in droplets.</b>

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:18.280
Today's just full of surprises, isn't it?

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.500
<b>The darkness of
a shining jewel...</b>

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.330
Sonshin, what are you thinking?

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.000
That card rapidly depletes 
your spiritual energy.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.470
How long do you think you'll 
last using it like that?

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.100
Don't talk to me!

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.020
If I get distracted, it's even worse.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.150
A sudden flash of insight in dire peril,

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:59.450
or perhaps he's just a fool?

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.460
It will be interesting to see.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:04.830
You sacrificed me over someone like this?

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.250
That's taking a joke too far.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.210
Of course not.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:14.470
I didn't return you to card state 
because I knew you could dodge it.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:18.500
Finish them off, Teifu-san.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.240
We have to do something.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.780
At this rate, it's a matter of time 
before the card loses its effect.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.420
Are we saved?

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.550
No, not yet.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.770
A brilliant inspiration.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:27.960
But that shield won't last forever.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:34.060
When it falls, my Hyappo 
Zenbai shall finish you!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.400
Damn it!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.820
Give me a break!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:41.820
It's like everything I did was just 
to make that old man look good.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.450
You did your job well.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:49.330
Please remember that I protected 
you, Hakuanshi-sama.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.060
Of course.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:58.210
The Hyappo Zenbai is invincible as long 
as its wielder can take 100 steps.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:02.090
If I can get close, I 
might just be able to win.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:06.470
But without water, I can't use the Zanroutou.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.840
You can't?

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:09.470
That's right.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.740
The damage is worse than I thought.

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:17.480
With my remaining spiritual energy, 
he can't generate ice himself.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.980
If I can't use that technique,

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.580
he'll run me through before I can get close.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.170
Damn it!

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:28.620
What do I do?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.910
Sonshin, once you stop using the card, run.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.870
Shuusou and I will draw the 
enemy as long as we can.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.500
That's impossible.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.750
Hakuanshi is after me.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.300
He'll try to capture me alive.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.380
How can you be sure?

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:45.550
There's no other way.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.140
Once your spiritual energy 
runs out, it will be too late!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.390
That's strange.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.950
A person with a normal 
amount of spiritual energy

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:58.400
would have long since run out.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.900
That boy can't be...

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.440
Damn it! There must be some way!

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:09.600
Think!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.960
There's got to be some way, right?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.800
That's it!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.320
Sonshin, stop using the card 
while you can still move!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.110
I'll stop using the card.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:33.110
But I'll be the one who runs at Teifu.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.060
What are you thinking?

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.880
You guys back me up.

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:38.810
Shuusou.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:43.860
If you have water, you can use that ice 
attack you used in the pool, right?

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:44.820
Y-Yeah...

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.820
Then there's still a chance!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.680
I like those eyes.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.860
So he's firm in his resolve?

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.410
This has been fun,

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.510
but it seems it's over.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.960
Ten, nine,

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.960
eight, seven,

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.970
six, five,

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:09.970
four, three,

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.970
two, one...

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.010
Zero!

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.860
What?

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:21.100
How brave he is, to rush me head on!

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.690
But I'll show no mercy!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.820
He's just desperate now?

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.330
Damn it all!

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:31.130
Here I come!

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:33.950
Shuusou!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:37.960
What?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.420
Zanroutou!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:45.960
Sonshin!

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.670
Shuuyu!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.220
What?

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:56.600
Curse you...

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.960
Not bad.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.100
Leave the rest to us.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.480
Teifu, prepare to die!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.110
Teifu, come back!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.990
I-I have failed...

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.240
That was splendid teamwork.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:17.350
We'll meet again.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.120
Wait!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.320
I won't let you get away!

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.130
Wait, Shuuyu! Don't follow him!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.880
Now's our only chance to beat him!

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:26.750
Sonshin!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.300
You're at your limit!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.630
Stay here.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.480
We'll bring back Shuuyu-dono.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:37.980
Wait!

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:48.010
<i>I had no idea one of Kentei's 
servants was so powerful.</i>

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.540
I have to go.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.060
Shuuyu...

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.800
Up there?

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.320
Did you find her?

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:25.230
No. No luck.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.580
But it's strange...

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:30.980
How did he still have the spiritual 
power to summon Shuuyu-dono?

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:35.670
I felt his spiritual power increase 
for a single instant back there.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.490
If that wasn't a mistake...

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:41.240
He still hasn't used his full power?

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.120
Is that possible?

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.800
Let's just find Shuuyu.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.020
I've been waiting for you.

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:11.510
You...

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:14.230
That was all an act, wasn't it?

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.200
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.170
<i>I'm using more and more 
of my spiritual power.</i>

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.700
<i>I need to turn her back into 
a card as soon as I can.</i>

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.550
You're a foolish general,

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:34.300
not to listen to your lord.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:37.470
No!

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.580
Sh-Shuuyu!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:58.490
Shuuyu!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:00.820
Shuuyu!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.260
Hang in there!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:04.730
What's this?

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:06.620
Shuuyu!

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:14.300
Sonshin-dono!

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:16.140
Are you okay?

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:22.930
That's...

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.140
Kayuu!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:31.080
Which means this is no normal wound.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.190
I-It'll heal, right?

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:41.200
We'll have to show Grandfather 
before I can say anything.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:44.190
Ryou'un, please...

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:49.080
Save Shuuyu...

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:50.580
Sonshin!

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.000
It's even on the card?

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.360
Ryou'un-sama, it's dangerous here.

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.030
We have to get away.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:00.970
Let's go.

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:02.970
You can't mean...

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:04.420
Yes.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.470
To the Southern Palace!

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.870
She'll show me the rest of the way.

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:15.980
I'm counting on you.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:23.580
Poor Sonshin-kun passed out again.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:24.660
How cute.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:30.000
<b>Arrow</b>

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.200
A light fades into the darkness.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.170
The woman's flame is a mirage.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.110
Wounded prey,

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:09.780
a stalking beast...

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:13.160
When the moonlight illuminates the path,

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.270
a raging ax struggles.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.920
Next time: "Ebisu."
